WEBVTT

00:01:29.961 --> 00:01:31.838
I think sometimes, we get so caught up

00:01:31.879 --> 00:01:36.134
in talking about what capitalism
could or should be

00:01:36.134 --> 00:01:39.679
that we forget what it has been
and what it is.

00:01:39.720 --> 00:01:42.014
So I wanted to just take
a minute to do some,

00:01:42.056 --> 00:01:44.308
like, greatest hits of capitalism.

00:01:44.767 --> 00:01:49.355
They include electric light,
personal mobile phones,

00:01:49.397 --> 00:01:52.817
cheap fertilizer, commercial aviation.

00:01:52.859 --> 00:01:55.653
And current capitalists
are working on cool stuff

00:01:55.695 --> 00:02:00.616
like cryptocurrencies and geoengineering